# 5. Strings

**Kya hai?** Characters ka sequence, immutable.
**Kyun?** Text data handle karne ke liye (name, email, messages).

```python
s = "Hello Python"
print(s[0], s[-1])       # H n
print(s[0:5])            # Hello  (slicing)
print(s[::-1])           # nohtyP olleH (reverse)
print(s[::2])            # step 2
print(len(s))
print("Hi " * 3)         # repetition
print("a" + "b")         # concatenation
```

